      <p>One Nation was simultaneously running direct issue advocacy praising the same candidate on the same themes. One preserved One Nation page announced a $6 million Alaska campaign and asked viewers to “CALL AND THANK DAN S. SULLIVAN FOR PROTECTING OUR PRIVACY,” crediting him for the Homebuyers Privacy Protection Act.</p>

      <EvidenceFigure
